# Byte-stability for hash-pinned receipts.
# MANIFEST.sha256 and OAI_FAMILY_017_CORE_CERTIFICATE.md carry published
# SHA-256 values computed over CRLF bytes (Windows origin). Forcing eol=crlf
# keeps every checkout byte-identical, so the CI hash gates hold on all
# platforms. No other file carries a published byte hash.
MANIFEST.sha256 text eol=crlf
OAI_FAMILY_017_CORE_CERTIFICATE.md text eol=crlf
